HB0193 Real property-severance of pore space-notice.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Brown, L, Banks, Heiner and Larsen,
L and Senator(s) Barlow and Boner
AN ACT relating to property; requiring notice of the severance of the pore space
in conveyances of real property and disclosure statements; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
